    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Crafted for the scholars of Minas Tirith, these robes offer a sanctuary of focus against the chaos of the world. The thick indigo cloth provides a sturdy shield, ensuring that a wizard's concentration remains unbroken even amidst the fray."
